  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n__Given Equation:__ 167 + 85 – 5 × 4 ÷ 36 = 199\n\n1) **÷ and × →**\n\n→ 167 + 85 – 5 ÷ 4 × 36 = 199\n\n→ 167 + 85 – 45 = 199\n\n→ 252 – 45 = 199\n\n→ 207 ≠ 199\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n2) **÷ and - →**\n\n**→ 167 + 85 ÷ 5 × 4 - 36 = 199**\n\n**→ 167 + 17 × 4 - 36 = 199**\n\n**→ 167 + 68 - 36 = 199**\n\n**→ 235**** - 36 = 199**\n\n→ 199 = 199\n\n→ LHS = RHS → Satisfies the equation.\n\n3) **× and + →**\n\n→ 167 × 85 – 5 + 4 ÷ 36 = 199\n\n→ 167 × 85 – 5 + 0.11 = 199\n\n→ 14195 – 5 + 0.11 = 199\n\n→ 14195.11 – 5 = 199\n\n→ 14190.11 – 5 ≠ 199\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n4) **- and × →**\n\n→ 167 + 85 × 5 - 4 ÷ 36 = 199\n\n→ 167 + 85 × 5 - 0.11 = 199\n\n→ 592 - 0.11 = 199\n\n→ 591.89 ≠ 199\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 2 satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"÷ and -\".",
